  "description": "A mirror of 38 layers from the Town of East Hampton, New York [MapServiceForOpenGov](https://eh-gis.ehamptonny.gov/arcgis/rest/services/MapServiceForOpenGov/MapServer) ArcGIS service: zoning and overlay districts, wetlands, coastal management areas, FEMA flood zones, trails, and conservation easements. Each layer is a GeoParquet file in the Town's coordinate system (EPSG:2263) with PMTiles for the map. The Town states that the service \"contains draft data that may be incomplete\". Read the [terms](LICENSE.md) before you use the data, and read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before you query it.",
